# Inno Setup output
installer/Output/

# Note: Inter + JetBrains Mono fonts and the app/tray icons ARE committed so the
# project builds out of the box. Only the OAuth secret and the multi-hundred-MB
# yt-dlp.exe / ffmpeg.exe binaries are excluded (fetch via scripts/).
